      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luudayeeda muy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoosinyi ng'asheega uurji gea ghayi sisna aba ng'eanyiida Misri, was heeda ghayi oopiiti, ak ea majasna ng'asheega uurji gea ghayi sina aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani, was heeda aayaacheegwa. Mwajabeawana jeeda deaweedeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeang'waaanya diigheanyeekeasu nea giing'waanyi deaweedajeegeasu ak gibeawi jeeda. Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajang'waanya deaweedajeegeasu ea diigheanyeekeasu, ak gisini gida ama sin siida gaygoobiida: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida wassean adagwaluudayi sea dea duupchi ea ghwadaah dawiishnataanyi. Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiimwaaldi ak gidaahi dawiishnata gweanu, nea dawiishnata geamadu gil; nih geamadu, mwaydaaha dawiishnataanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adijaadi dawiishnata gatmooda gweanu; aba gideaba nih dawiishnata gweanu gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adijaadi dawiishnata huda geamadu, ea huda gweanu ghana ea huda geamadu, ada eejiilsa ghaheang'wa ghana eejiilsa gealga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata huda orjeedang'u ghana ea hudeaba daang'u, aba gideaba dawiishnacheeka nyaawa dawiishnataang'u gil ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata huda gatmooda gweanu, ghayi jih sea gweanu, aba gideaba huda geamadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata huda ghamagweanu; aba gideaba gatmooda was buweacheanda gweanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata huda ghamageamadu, aba gideaba gatmooda was buweacheanda geamadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata orjeeda ghamagweanu, nea gideaba mayweesiina gatmoadaanyi; aba gideaba niny huda ghamagweanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata gatmooda orjeedang'u; aba gideaba gatmooda orjeedang'u, mwaydaaha dawiishnataanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata gatmooda orjeeda geamadu; aba gideaba nih dawiishnata orjeeda geamadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gijaadi dawiishnata gatmooda ea dea hudaanyi, ak ea adigheani huda orjeedaanyi ghana hudeaba daanyi ak gidaahi dawiishnataanyi; aba gideaba gadeemga was buweadeagaagu; nih eamuy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea adiidu gigeendeayi gatmooda sea huda ghaamwat ak ghoah gatmooda jea gwanyeanyisiinyi, ak gijaadi dawiishnataanyi nea gudugwanda huda ghaamwat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu gineekiisi gatmooda ak gidaahi dawiishnataanyi nea gwaneaweesa eaghwada aba gideaba gaba ririnnyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiluudayeewi gatmooda gischeewoocheandaang'u, ak gibwari geaw ririnnyeanda aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu googeanu eara jeabwagi aba jeeda diibigeagwa ak ghoabwari darari gheawunga ASEATAANG'U. Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giluudayeewi ng'eedeeda gawuurji gil iluudayeewi gatmooda; ng'asheanji nih eamuy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea adiidu giluudayeewi diyeayda wassean ak gibwari geaw ririnnyeanda aba badaydaanyi, nea eara gatmooda wassean ea adaghoadaw geaw diyeayda gwaluudayi: nih eamuy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adoabwari geat ririnnyeanda aba gida wasean aba jeedeaba haleanjeeni, nea aba ng'asheesu seaniin eemoojiga aahoanyi aba madeedeang'wean ning'uda geat ririnnyeanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gamunyiit ng'eanyiida, ea dalas aba munyindaanyi, ak ghahoan ng'eanyiida buuneeda mida jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeang'waanya deaweedajeegeasu ea diigheanyeekeasu ak ea adoosinyi ng'asheesu munyasiin, ada ea siideaba ng'eang'i gil ghana ea rabascheanda mida jeedeang'wa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(aba gideaba ng'asheesu sean munyasiin gwasina fuga ng'eanyiida, mida madeedeang'wa, ak geabwara ng'eanyiida ririnnyeanda); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyoosinyi ng'asheesu gaygwahistaneegwa ng'eanyiida, iyoabwari ririnnyeanda, gawuurji gida jakteaydaneegwa eemeeda mida madeedeang'wa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida wassean jea gwasin ng'asheanda wassean aba jeedeaba ng'asheesu munyasiin, fuga sina ng'asheesu gajeasach aba jeeda fuga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ang'waanya huumeandeanyu ak ea adisini eara akaleala aba jeedeaba searoojisu munyas sisna aba jeedeang'wean, ak ea adoabwari geat ririnnyeanda aba ng'asheesu: Aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
